                                                "sense_id": "dca48790-64b5-333d-953c-e812812eb2e0",
                                                "text": "There was still time amid the drama for Ashley Cole to almost mark his 97th cap with a goal but the erratic Pyatov made a fine recovery save after another inelegant attempt to deal with a cross."
